### 3.3 Processing Logic

| Rule ID | Condition | Action | Severity |
|---------|-----------|--------|----------|
| RULE-001 | Green | No action required | None |
| RULE-002 | Yellow | Incident response protocol | Medium |
| RULE-003 | Red | Remote wipe of the asset | High |

### 3.4 Detection Rules (YAML Format)

```yaml
# Rule Template
- rule_id: RULE-003
  name: Asset Red
  description: Asset has been lost or stolen
  trigger: Real Time
  condition:
    - Asset triggers incident response
    - Confirmed via employee: asset is confirmed missing or remains outside of geofence without constant employee feedback that the asset is secured
    - Employee has been deemed compromised and management gives authorization to remote wipe
  action:
    - severity: high
    - alert: SOC Report, automatic level 2 (High) priority alarm
    - auto_remediate: False - to be reviewed by Security Administrator
  sla: 30 minutes
```

